  hiredMemo: Margaret found 14 security holes, changed every password, and caught
    the accountant moving money into a company called 'Totally Real Business LLC'.
    She taped over Dale's webcam permanently. Hackers are afraid of her. So is Dale.
  hirePerformance: 3
  rejectedMemo: Margaret Ironside was hired by Competitor Corp. Their security is
